\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces High-level architecture of the proposed framework. The system consists of a modality routing model, specialized disease classifiers, Explainable AI modules, and a Federated Learning infrastructure connecting multiple healthcare institutions.}}{45}{figure.caption.15}%
